    "encoding_note": "AXI4-Stream defines no line code; it is a synchronous-logic interface. Byte meaning is encoded by TKEEP/TSTRB (data / position / null bytes); packet framing by TLAST; routing by TID/TDEST. The 'tables' here are the signal, byte-type, concept, and width tables from the AXI4-Stream specification."
